      "hidden_reasoning": "Dragapult used U-turn, so I need to switch out. Kingambit is at 78% with Supreme Overlord down one faint already — I'm weighing Garchomp for the Earthquake coverage despite the Sucker Punch risk, and checking if Mega Evolution opens up after switching.\n\nGholdengo is risky since Ghost takes double damage from Dark-type Sucker Punch while Steel is only neutral. Garchomp seems like the better call here, bringing Rough Skin chip damage against Kingambit's Life Orb recoil as I send it in.\n\n",
